{
  "$comment": "Realising chg's tokens (docs/rules/chg.md): a token's lexemes, the base in its citation cell (chg's tokens choose no feature values: its suffixes are lexemes of their own), the others in their allomorphs, joined and rewritten by chg's rules (lexicons/chg/language.yaml, lexemes.yaml). An allomorph marked `free` (a scribe's other spelling) is never chosen: each that holds gives the token an alternative. realise/free/* run zz, an invented language given whole; realise/chg/* chg's own lexicon, one vector or more per allomorph condition and rewrite, each a token of the course (its surface in the note).",
